Package: jq-lite
Architecture: all
Depends: libjq-lite-perl (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends}
Description: lightweight jq-compatible JSON processor written in Perl
 jq-lite is a command-line JSON processor implemented in pure Perl. It provides
 jq-like filtering and transformation features without requiring a compiled jq
 binary, making it suitable for portable and constrained environments.

Package: libjq-lite-perl
Section: perl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends}
Description: lightweight jq-compatible JSON query engine for Perl
 JQ::Lite is a pure-Perl JSON query engine with jq-compatible filtering and
 transformation features. This package contains the reusable Perl modules used
 by the jq-lite command-line program.
